        </child>
        <child xsi:type="archimate:DiagramObject" id="id-00bc2a8470d14643a93fe0ee59e595bb" targetConnections="id-a816a619acfc432186f809993290a380" font="1|Comfortaa|11.0|0|GTK|1|" lineColor="#1a5fb4" fillColor="#62a0ea" alpha="96" textPosition="1" archimateElement="id-387f7e58454e4cf6a5edf8ee72c9f938">
          <bounds x="744" y="180" width="217" height="73"/>
          <feature name="gradient" value="0"/>
          <feature name="deriveElementLineColor" value="false"/>
          <sourceConnection xsi:type="archimate:Connection" id="id-a5ab8877e38449c5abae3343400f8cd5" source="id-00bc2a8470d14643a93fe0ee59e595bb" target="id-38f501ff830c448c9a2bd43b5ab90ba0" archimateRelationship="id-39799fd46d9d48e791987f0d43567f29"/>
        </child>
        <documentation>Organizations create sustainable value by understanding their customers and translating their needs into products and services that provide meaningful outcomes. The **Deliver Customer Value** value stream represents this end-to-end perspective, from understanding customer needs through developing and delivering a solution to providing ongoing customer support.

The value stream consists of four consecutive stages: **Understand Customer Needs**, **Develop Customer Solution**, **Deliver Customer Solution**, and **Support Customer**. Each stage contributes a specific part of the overall customer value and builds upon the outcome of the preceding stage. Together, they provide a coherent view of how customer needs are transformed into delivered and supported solutions.

Several organizational capabilities enable these stages. **Customer Experience Management (CXM)** provides insight into customer needs and experiences, **Software Development** enables the development of digital solutions, **Service Delivery** ensures that solutions are delivered effectively, and **Customer Support** assists customers in their use of these solutions.

**Customer Relationship Management** provides a common capability across the entire value stream. It enables the organization to maintain a consistent understanding of the customer throughout the customer journey and connects customer interactions across the different stages. In this way, the strategic view shows both **how value is created** and **which capabilities the organization requires to create that value**.
</documentation>
      </element>
