        <child xsi:type="archimate:Group" id="id-c62d8bdf7ab44e3f8cd5d8db90779ef2" name="Legend" textAlignment="1" fillColor="#f6f5f4">
          <bounds x="1007" y="372" width="242" height="62"/>
          <child xsi:type="archimate:Note" id="id-d66a4d8e981f4e2685d3a478312411ba" font="1|Comfortaa|11.0|0|GTK|1|" lineColor="#26a269" textAlignment="1" fillColor="#2ec27e" alpha="0" borderType="2">
            <bounds x="72" y="24" width="157" height="37"/>
            <feature name="gradient" value="0"/>
            <feature name="deriveElementLineColor" value="false"/>
            <content>  Scope of Program</content>
          </child>
          <child xsi:type="archimate:Group" id="id-bd5bfbbf2d564f1d9bd8a64c0e5753f7" font="1|Comfortaa|11.0|0|GTK|1|" lineColor="#26a269" fillColor="#2ec27e" alpha="96" textPosition="1" borderType="1">
            <bounds x="12" y="24" width="61" height="25"/>
            <feature name="gradient" value="0"/>
            <feature name="deriveElementLineColor" value="false"/>
          </child>
        </child>
        <documentation>This view illustrates how the **Improve Customer Engagement** program contributes to the **Deliver Customer Value** value stream. The program is represented as an ArchiMate **Work Package**, highlighted in green to distinguish the planned transformation from the existing capabilities and value streams. One of its key objectives is to introduce **Conclude Customer Engagement** as a new stage in the customer lifecycle, ensuring that products, services, and customer relationships can be concluded in a controlled, transparent, and customer-oriented manner.

In addition, the program aims to improve the **Customer Relationship Management** capability, which supports the entire customer lifecycle. These improvements focus on strengthening customer information management, streamlining interactions, and ensuring continuity across all stages of the value stream. Together, these initiatives contribute to a more consistent customer experience, improved operational efficiency, and stronger customer relationships, including when individual services or engagements come to an end.</documentation>
      </element>
    </folder>
