        </child>
        <child xsi:type="archimate:Note" id="id-5576c72f37c84fa6b0f4d934880bad8d" font="1|Noto Sans|9.0|0|GTK|1|" textAlignment="1" alpha="0" borderType="2">
          <bounds x="28" y="108" width="120" height="25"/>
          <content>Documentation:</content>
        </child>
        <child xsi:type="archimate:Note" id="id-68ff598873584ea88b53320b0057911d" font="1|Noto Sans|9.0|0|GTK|1|" textAlignment="1" fillColor="#f6f5f4" alpha="64" borderType="1">
          <bounds x="24" y="180" width="284" height="77"/>
          <feature name="lineStyle" value="3"/>
          <sourceConnection id="id-d6654e8d9a0d400ab128dd2b72e8d8c9" lineWidth="2" lineColor="#1a5fb4" source="id-68ff598873584ea88b53320b0057911d" target="id-0b08adbc4ebc41d19908f09424679353" type="1"/>
        </child>
        <child xsi:type="archimate:Note" id="id-3b07dafa67784a938d54bcffbdcdabfc" font="1|Noto Sans|9.0|0|GTK|1|" textAlignment="1" alpha="0" borderType="2">
          <bounds x="28" y="192" width="120" height="25"/>
          <content>Name:</content>
        </child>
        <child xsi:type="archimate:Note" id="id-6d54b4f55f6b489986abbd90df34c7f3" font="1|Noto Sans|9.0|0|GTK|1|" textAlignment="1" alpha="0" borderType="2">
          <bounds x="28" y="228" width="120" height="25"/>
          <content>Documentation:</content>
        </child>
        <child xsi:type="archimate:Note" id="id-312919ad809d44279b92593b6427a065" font="1|Noto Sans|9.0|0|GTK|1|" textAlignment="1" borderType="1">
          <bounds x="148" y="192" width="156" height="25"/>
          <content>Section</content>
        </child>
        <child xsi:type="archimate:Note" id="id-ce77741df1ba48cda1035fc929090d8d" font="1|Noto Sans|9.0|0|GTK|1|" textAlignment="1" borderType="1">
          <bounds x="148" y="228" width="156" height="25"/>
          <content>&lt;Markdown text></content>
        </child>
        <documentation>The `Section` artifact behaves differently depending on how you configure its properties:

* **Section with a Label Expression:** Generates a formatted heading (based on the label) followed by the text placed in its documentation field.
* **Section without a Label Expression:** Generates a plain text block without a heading. This is especially useful for adding standalone paragraphs, notes, or descriptions that you might want to style later using custom CSS classes.

**Follow these steps to add custom formatted text:**

1. **Enhance your existing Section:** Select the `Section` group you created in Section 4.1 (the one with the Label Expression set to `Hello World!`).
2. **Add Text under the Header:** In the Properties panel, switch to the **Documentation** tab. This is where you write your custom content. Copy and paste the following Markdown text:
```markdown
Welcome to our first ArchiFabric document. 
This section demonstrates how a Label Expression creates a header, 
while this text is placed directly beneath it.
```

3. **Create a Standalone Text Block:** Drag a new **Group** element onto the canvas and drop it inside your main `Document` group, placing it below your first Section.
4. **Configure the Text Block:** Set its **Name** to `Section`. **Leave the Label Expression empty.**
5. **Add Markdown Content:** In the Documentation tab of this new Section, add some sample text, such as:
```markdown
*Note: Because this Section has no Label Expression, 
it renders as a clean text block without a header. 
This makes it perfect for custom styling later.*
```


6. **Generate the Output:** Run the ArchiFabric script again and save your file.

When you open the updated PDF, you will see how ArchiFabric handles both scenarios: your first section has a clear header with text below it, while the second section seamlessly blends in as a standalone paragraph.</documentation>
        <property key="Lead" value="Architectural models provide the core data, but a good report often requires additional context, introductions, or conclusions. You can add custom text directly to your document using the **Section** artifact. ArchiFabric fully supports Markdown, allowing you to easily format your text without needing complex editors."/>
      </element>
      <element xsi:type="archimate:ArchimateDiagramModel" name="My first document" id="id-5d9eb981e9fa4950b39ebb7829c381fb">
        <child xsi:type="archimate:Group" id="id-1cce485f8b2b410eb4ddbe702f2cc62a" name="Document" targetConnections="id-366f02bee8cb46749549ae052fcac5b4" font="1|Noto Sans|9.0|0|GTK|1|" textAlignment="1">
          <bounds x="420" y="43" width="400" height="180"/>
          <feature name="labelExpression" value="My First Document"/>
          <child xsi:type="archimate:Group" id="id-58c13c30451443d5bcb52ef3d32d3d02" name="Section" targetConnections="id-69712bfbeff3401bba557ba5f6db8b2a" font="1|Noto Sans|9.0|0|GTK|1|" textAlignment="1">
            <bounds y="60" width="400" height="49"/>
            <feature name="labelExpression" value="Hello World!"/>
